<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh taka ends flat in dull trading.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh taka ends flat in dull trading.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bangladesh taka closed unchanged at 42.5495/5500 to the dollar in interbank trading in dull trading, dealers said.</p>
<p>The local unit opened at Monday's close and remained at the same level in yet another low-key session.</p>
<p>Dealers said banks had not responded to demands for dollar, forcing many buyers to go to the central bank.</p>
<p>The call money rates finished unchanged at 6.0 to 7.0 percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +88-02-506363</p>
